<section id="S5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.4 </span>Ablation experiments</h3>

<section id="S5.SS4.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">5.4.1 </span>The influence of BFM and CLSE</h4>

<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Ablation experiment on the CLSE and BFM. (<span id="S5.T4.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Red</span>: the best)</figcaption>
<div id="S5.T4.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:94.5pt;vertical-align:-46.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-231.2pt,63.3pt) scale(0.427273147486557,0.427273147486557) ;">
<table id="S5.T4.4.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T4.4.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T4.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"></th>
<th id="S5.T4.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" colspan="2">Method</th>
<th id="S5.T4.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" colspan="6">MSRS (both blurred) scale:8</th>
